* KiCad-side wrappers for the SuperIt project (generated by gen_kicad.py).
* KiCad attaches one SPICE model to a whole multi-unit symbol, so the dual
* triode (with its heater), the dual op-amp and the bridge rectifier are
* wrapped here around the single-section models in superit.lib.

* 12AT7 dual triode, heater pins 4-5 (12.6 V, 150 mA)
.subckt 12AT7_DUAL A1 G1 K1 A2 G2 K2 H4 H5
XA A1 G1 K1 12AT7
XB A2 G2 K2 12AT7
RH H4 H5 84
.ends

* 12AX7 dual triode, heater pins 4-5 (12.6 V, 150 mA)
.subckt 12AX7_DUAL A1 G1 K1 A2 G2 K2 H4 H5
XA A1 G1 K1 12AX7
XB A2 G2 K2 12AX7
RH H4 H5 84
.ends

* dual op-amp package, 8-pin DIP numbering order
.subckt OPAMP_DUAL OUTA INNA INPA VN INPB INNB OUTB VP
XA INPA INNA VP VN OUTA OPAMP
XB INPB INNB VP VN OUTB OPAMP
.ends

* bridge rectifier
.subckt BRIDGE P N AC1 AC2
DA AC1 P D1N4007
DB AC2 P D1N4007
DC N AC1 D1N4007
DD N AC2 D1N4007
.ends
